// Signature module for `fortis.prelude` (Language Reference 4.3: imported implicitly into every module).
// Every function is `trusted` and bodiless: these are the names and signatures the checker knows;
// bodies are intrinsics (DEL-26) or Fortis written later. This file is parsed by the syntax runner.

